---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Kylie Kelly | Grow Your Email List Without Social Media">

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="bg-black text-white px-6 py-24">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      <div>
        <p class="script-accent text-pink text-2xl mb-4">the right rooms</p>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold leading-tight mb-6">
          You don't need to be louder.<br />You just need the <span class="script-accent italic text-pink-light">right rooms.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-warmgray text-base mb-8 max-w-md">
          I help coaches, course creators and service providers grow their email list and make consistent sales, without posting every day, dancing on reels, or waiting for the algorithm to notice them.
        </p>
        <a href="https://www.skool.com/email-marketing-skool/about" class="btn-pink">Join the Free Community →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hidden md:block">
        <div class="aspect-[4/5] bg-warmgray/20 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-warmgray text-sm">
          [ portrait photo ]
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-3 mt-16 pt-10 border-t border-white/10 text-center">
      <div><p class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold">6200+</p><p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-warmgray mt-2">women supported worldwide</p></div>
      <div class="border-x border-white/10"><p class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold">250+</p><p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-warmgray mt-2">podcast episodes &amp; counting</p></div>
      <div><p class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold">0</p><p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-warmgray mt-2">reels danced to get there 😉</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 50 A DAY CALLOUT -->
  <section class="bg-offwhite px-6 py-16 text-center">
    <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-muted mb-3">Email marketing for women who are done with the algorithm</p>
    <a href="/50-a-day" class="btn-primary">Start with 50 A Day, $27 →</a>
  </section>

  <!-- SOCIAL PROOF -->
  <section class="px-6 py-20">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
      <p class="script-accent text-pink text-xl mb-3">what happens when you get in the right room</p>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold mb-6">$25K in revenue. 1,100+ subscribers in 7 days.<br class="hidden sm:block" /> No social media required.</h2>
      <p class="text-muted mb-8">
        Those results came from one aligned collaboration, being in the right rooms, and emails that actually convert. Not from posting more. Not from doing everything. From focusing on what actually moves the needle.
      </p>
      <a href="https://www.skool.com/email-marketing-skool/about" class="btn-pink">Join Email Marketing Skool →</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="divider-pink mx-auto" />

  <!-- WAYS TO WORK TOGETHER -->
  <section class="bg-offwhite px-6 py-20">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-3">Ways to work together</h2>
      <p class="text-muted text-center max-w-xl mx-auto mb-12">Each room is designed for a different stage of your journey.</p>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-8">
          <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold mb-2">1:1 Private Strategy</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted mb-4">One focused conversation to get unstuck. Your offer, your list, your launch plan, my full attention and a clear action plan.</p>
          <p class="font-semibold mb-4">$297 USD &middot; Limited availability</p>
          <a href="https://tidycal.com/kyliekelly/straetgy-session-website" class="btn-outline text-xs !py-2 !px-5">Book the Call →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-8">
          <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold mb-2">The Shop</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted mb-4">Grab-and-go courses, templates and AI tools that work while you sleep. Start with 50 A Day ($27) or browse the full shop.</p>
          <a href="https://shop.kyliekelly.com/" class="btn-outline text-xs !py-2 !px-5">Browse the Shop →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-8">
          <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold mb-2">Free Community</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted mb-4">Email Marketing Skool, where thousands of women are growing their lists without the burnout. Upgrade to premium when you're ready.</p>
          <a href="https://www.skool.com/email-marketing-skool/about" class="btn-outline text-xs !py-2 !px-5">Join Free →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- EMPRESS METHOD -->
  <section class="px-6 py-20">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
      <p class="script-accent text-pink text-xl mb-3">the model behind the rooms I build</p>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">The Empress Method</h2>
      <p class="text-muted max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12">
        When audience, authority, and cash work together, growth becomes simpler, steadier, and far more powerful.
      </p>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-10 text-left">
        <div>
          <p class="text-pink font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">Audience</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted">Through collaborations, partnerships, podcasting, and email growth, visibility becomes relational, not performative. You're seen in rooms that already trust you.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-pink font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">Authority</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted">Built through trust, consistency, and leadership. Guest features, PR, media, and thought-led visibility position you as the go-to, so people don't just find you, they remember you.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-pink font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">Cash</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted">This is where clarity turns into income. Simple sales rhythms, scalable offers, and intentional planning. Revenue becomes steady, not stressful.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PODCAST PROMO -->
  <section class="bg-black text-white px-6 py-20">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">The Email Growth <span class="script-accent italic text-pink-light">Show</span></h2>
      <p class="text-warmgray max-w-xl mx-auto mb-8">
        Honest conversations about visibility, trust, and building a business off social media. A top 1.5% podcast, with new episodes every Friday.
      </p>
      <a href="/podcast" class="btn-pink">Listen to the Podcast →</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
